// Day 26 - error rate over time, by endpoint.
//
// Question this answers: is a given endpoint's failure rate rising, falling, or
// flat, and which endpoint is driving it? Bucketed into 5-minute bins so a
// transient blip is visible as a shape, not flattened into one summary number -
// the same bin size the error-rate alert (infra/modules/alerting.bicep) evaluates
// on, so this query is the "why did it fire" companion to that alert, not a
// different metric wearing the same name.
requests
| where timestamp > ago(1h)
| summarize
    Total = count(),
    Failed = countif(success == false),
    ErrorRatePercent = round(100.0 * countif(success == false) / count(), 2)
    by EndpointName = name, TimeBucket = bin(timestamp, 5m)
| order by EndpointName asc, TimeBucket asc
